Tuikio: let the court follow the terminal (at most upstream's 130x28) instead of requiring a
130x28 terminal, so it plays at 80x24 on a phone held sideways. The key legend under the court is
shortened to fit 80 columns, and the menu title is drawn with half-block pixels (which the app
draws itself) instead of sextant characters, which many Android fonts lack.

